Subject: segmented control v2: a fit-to-labels modifier

What: `segmented-control-v2--fit` sizes the control to its labels (width auto,
items flex 1 1 auto) beside the existing `--full-width` modifier.
Why: the 232px design width is wrong wherever the choices are two short words; the
Usage section showed each view name with 60px of empty track on both sides.

diff --git a/src/v2/components/segmented-control-v2.css b/src/v2/components/segmented-control-v2.css
index 42f59e9e3b87f09fcdd291e3fffa2d372b63e0f7..513899f3c8e45f4947c590a86acc9381c387dbf0 100644
--- a/src/v2/components/segmented-control-v2.css
+++ b/src/v2/components/segmented-control-v2.css
@@ -2,6 +2,14 @@
   width: 100%;
 }
 
+.ui-segmented-control-v2.segmented-control-v2--fit {
+  width: auto;
+}
+
+.segmented-control-v2--fit .ui-segmented-control-v2-item {
+  flex: 1 1 auto;
+}
+
 .ui-segmented-control-v2 {
   box-sizing: border-box;
   display: flex;
